{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Locust_4457 aims to encapsulate the fun of solving intricate puzzles found in ARG's while keeping everything within the bounds of the game. While it's a clear homage to Cicadia3301, it's approachable to those who find such puzzles daunting, while still hopefully stumping puzzle connoisseurs</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Solve Ciphers</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use in-game codecs to crack various ciphers including Caesar, morse code, binary and much more.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3909300/extras/69ba3200d3e13854f607ccde0176b993.avif?t=1768871338\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore the world around</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some puzzles will require you to look around town, interact with unique characters, and keep your eye out for anything out of the ordinary</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3909300/extras/ab05d65dcd566f4a332da1078f68082f.avif?t=1768871338\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>16 Unique Puzzles</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Puzzles follow a dynamic difficulty curve and can be completed in any order. If you find yourself stuck on one, try your hand at another!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3909300/extras/80c89a2bec38ecd90dfa407416a9b7c7.avif?t=1768871338\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>